          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi ikawapendeza mitume na wazee na kanisa lote kuwachagua watu miongoni mwao na kuwatuma Antiokia pamoja na Paulo na Barnaba; nao ni hawa, Yuda aliyeitwa Barsaba, na Sila, waliokuwa watu wakuu katika ndugu. Wakaandika hivi na kupeleka kwa mikono yao, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mitume na ndugu wazee, kwa ndugu zetu walioko Antiokia na Shamu na Kilikia, walio wa Mataifa; Salamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.15.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mdo 15:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwa kuwa tumesikia ya kwamba watu waliotoka kwetu wamewasumbua kwa maneno yao, wakipotosha roho zenu, ambao sisi hatukuwaagiza; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sisi tumeona vema, hali tumepatana kwa moyo mmoja, kuwachagua watu na kuwatuma kwenu pamoja na wapendwa wetu Barnaba na Paulo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "watu waliohatarisha maisha yao kwa ajili ya jina la Bwana wetu Yesu Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi tumewatuma Yuda na Sila, watakaowaambia wenyewe maneno yayo hayo kwa vinywa vyao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.23.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 23:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwa maana ilimpendeza Roho Mtakatifu na sisi, tusiwatwike mzigo ila hayo yaliyo lazima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaani, mjiepushe na vitu vilivyotolewa sadaka kwa sanamu, na damu, na nyama zilizosongolewa, na uasherati. Mkijizuia na hayo, mtafanya vema. Wasalamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
