              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baada ya siku kadhaa Paulo akamwambia Barnaba, Haya! Turejee sasa tukawaangalie hao ndugu katika kila mji tulipolihubiri neno la Bwana, wako hali gani. ",
          "type": "text",
